      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NO FIZZY DRINK (1) was a TG1-4W winner two back then out of the placings latest at Murray Bridge but moves to Box 1 this time where he has performed well. Speedy runner and should be in the action early from the inside. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. FANCY IN DESIGN (8) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (20.19) at this track. Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break from out wide. Likely to be about the money. OUR BELLA ROSE (2) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing 57 from 112 starts. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing second (20.04) at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Hard to beat again. COBALT WINTER (7) boasts a solid strike-rate over this track and distance.",
